        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFB5000, 2\" Universal Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's solid brass 2 Inch Universal Door Stop has a contemporary style. This universal door bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFB5000-specifications.gif?v=1704354662\" width\"290\" height=\"154\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Solid Brass 2 Inch Universal Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-1-2-inch-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufb4505\">1.5 Inch High Universal Door Stop</a></b> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-door-stop-ring-deltana-ufb4505rub\">Replacement Rubber Ring</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFB500 Large Universal Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Dark Gray</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/UFB5000.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFB5000 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 2 Inch Universal Door Stop",
                "description": "2 Inch Universal Door Stop, Deltana UFB5000 - Deltana's solid brass 2 Inch Universal Door Stop has a contemporary style. This universal door bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. Available in 12 great finishes. ",
                "keywords": "deltana UFB5000 Solid brass universal floor door stops, del-UFB5000 large Brass Universal Door Stops, wood door bumpers, wood door stops, steel door bumpers, steel door stops, doorstops, door dampers, rubber door stops, 2 inch high door stoppers, doorstoppers, wooden door stops, deltana universal 2 inches high Floor mounted Door Stops, DEL-UFB5000U10B, DEL-UFB5000U15, DEL-UFB5000U15A, DEL-UFB5000U14, DEL-UFB5000U19, DEL-UFB5000U26, DEL-UFB5000U26D, DEL-UFB5000U3, DEL-UFB5000U3-UNL, DEL-UFB5000U4, DEL-UFB5000U5, DEL-UFB5000CR003,"
